def about_page():return crumbs('Our story')+hero('Small-town roots.<br><span class="accent">Big-idea energy.</span>','The Relevant story','We started with a laptop, a vinyl cutter, and a belief that good ideas deserve to become real. That still sounds like us.','Come meet us','General project')+'<section class="section white-section"><div class="container story-grid"><div>'+eyebrow('Meet Nik. Meet Relevant.')+'<h2>From a living room<br>to Main Street.</h2><p class="story-meta">Nik Ingram · Owner, Relevant Design</p></div><div><blockquote class="quote">“I started this business in my mom’s living room with a laptop, a 24-inch vinyl cutter, and a bag of Doritos, cutting stickers for gokarts.”</blockquote><p>Today, we operate out of a 4,000-square-foot facility with a design area, consultation space, a production area for our signage department, and a workshop for specialty products.</p><p>As the work grew, so did the family: RD Graphics for physical graphics and signage, Alley Cats for screen printing, Copy Write for business print, Relevant for design and creative work, and Rocket for websites.</p></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container story-grid"><div>'+eyebrow('One Zillion Possibilities')+'<h2>There’s one that<br>fits just right.</h2></div><div><p>Even if you started today, at some point you run out of possibilities. At Relevant, we have One Zillion Possibilities because we have realized that out of all the possibilities, there is ONE that fits just right for you!</p><p>Our approach is unique in that we make things really simple. We don’t use big complicated words to describe what we do, who we are, and what you need.</p><p>We give our clients specific, tangible steps to take to accomplish their project.</p></div></div></section><section class="section work-section"><div class="container">'+img('events','Fireworks over downtown Columbia during a community event','story-photo')+'<div class="story-grid" style="margin-top:45px"><div>'+eyebrow('Sometimes, we really do make fireworks.')+'<h2>The night<br>Columbia lit up.</h2></div><div><p>It was almost Christmas, and we wanted dancing lights all over downtown Columbia. We ordered lighting controllers we had never touched before, mapped the lights, and started programming with less than 30 days to showtime.</p><p>Our practice was opening night. The show led into fireworks, and the cheers from the streets made the work worth it. That experience brought together the design, signage, planning, and production that had been part of our business all along.</p>'+textlink('Events & promotion','/events-promotion/')+'</div></div></div></section>'+brand_strip()+cta()

def event_page():return crumbs('Events & promotion')+hero('Make the moment<br><span class="accent">mean something.</span>','Events & promotion · Columbia, Mississippi','From the first banner to the final impression, bring a consistent look and a clear plan to your event. Our design, print, apparel, and signage experience helps the pieces work together.','Plan an event project','Events & Promotion',('events','Fireworks during a downtown Columbia community event'))+'<section class="section white-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div>'+eyebrow('One event. Many moving parts.')+'<h2>Bring it all together.</h2></div><p>We’ve worked on community celebrations, church events, promotions, and business displays. Tell us the occasion, the venue, and the date.</p></div><div class="product-grid">'+''.join(f'<article class="product"><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>' for t,d in [('Event identity & graphics','A consistent look for your event name, promotion, signs, handouts, and shirts.'),('Banners & directional signs','Vinyl banners, yard signs, directional graphics, and venue information to help people find their way.'),('Branded displays','Retractable banners, feather flags, tension fabric stands, table throws, and step-and-repeat backdrops.'),('Event apparel','Custom shirts through Alley Cats for staff, volunteers, attendees, and fundraising.'),('Print & promotion','Flyers, brochures, cards, and supporting print through Copy Write Printing.'),('Creative production & consulting','Talk with us about your event vision. Lighting, media, and other production needs are scoped individually.')])+'</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-col"><div>'+eyebrow('Experience behind the idea')+'<h2>Yes, sometimes<br>there are fireworks.</h2></div><div><p>Our original website tells the story of Christmas 2018, when we programmed a downtown Columbia light show on a tight timeline and opening night became the first full run-through.</p><p>That project reflects the way we approach events: connect the creative vision with the practical details. Specialty production depends on the venue and scope—let’s talk before you plan around it.</p>'+textlink('Read our story','/about/')+'</div></div></section>'+cta('What’s the<br>big occasion?','Tell us your date, location, and the experience you want to create.')

